ndlord wins next turn unless teammate can beat landlord’s last card later.  \n\n**Reason:**  \nThe most urgent threat is landlord’s last card. Since my teammate passed after ♥9, it’s likely they cannot beat ♥9 with a single. Therefore, I must play to take control now, then try to pass to teammate. Between my two singles, ♥J is higher and blocks potential landlord card of J or lower. Also, by playing ♥J, I keep a middle card (♣10) and a low card (♣8), allowing flexibility for later if teammate needs help.  \n\n**Answer:**  \n{"cards": ["♥J"]}'}
